---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <div
        class="flex flex-row items-center w-full dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors text-left"
    >
        <div
            class="rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200 p-5 w-full  bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors flex flex-row items-center shadow-md"
        >
            <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="1em"
                height="1em"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
                <path d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path>
                <path
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="m21 21l-4.486-4.494M19 10.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 1-17 0a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 17 0Z"
                ></path>
            </svg>

            <input
                type="text"
                class="flex-1 ml-2 p-0 border-none bg-transparent outline-none text-base leading-none"
            />
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="flex flex-col items-center w-full dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors text-left"
    >
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-horizontal gap-2 flex-wrap container"></div>
        <div
            class="rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200 p-5 w-full m-5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-md"
        >
            <span id="description" class="lg:text-xl md:text-lg">聲明</span>
            <div class="lg:text-lg md:text-md">
                <br />
                1. 本頁面之文章，除另行聲明，又或得到作者令行批准，否則全數依CC BY-NC-SA之協議開源。
                <br /><br />
                2. 本頁面之文章，不論中文或英文，皆由人類所編寫。過程中未使用任何AI。然而本網頁之製作或有少量借鑑AI工具，以協助解決TypeScript及CSS上的問題。詳情請參閱Colophon頁面。
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
